{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "864d4356b6d028a4fcbcdb17ad27f5e0aeecb2df5fd396d5b2e3f6cd6fd4f0d0", "ja": "ウラ！ウラ！ウラ！ウラ！！☆大勝負", "zh": "呜啦！呜啦！呜啦！呜啦！！☆决胜时刻", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "728b2bcd597737b5c58e70bb9b5ccd97738071fb6dc56e019080c9d24701e1bf", "ja": "遺跡を発見した探検隊。だが扉が開かない。\nそこに社長が現れ、全ては自分が宝を手にす\nるための策略だったと明かす。お宝をかけた\nじゃんけん勝負でプロデューサーに負けた社\n長は、扉を開く合い言葉を教えてくれた。", "zh": "探险队发现了遗迹，门却打不开。\n此时社长现身向一行人揭露，\n这一切都是自己为了获得宝物的策略。\n双方以宝物为赌注猜拳决胜负，社长输给\n制作人后，将开门的口号告知探险队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b73e7de819f199c05de7b2fda87f4ac143248b89395cd7df7c0a681115ec4fd5", "ja": "（まみたま探検隊は、途中でターザンごっこを\nしたりしつつ、順調に先へ進んでいった）", "zh": "（真美阿环探险队在路途上玩着泰山游戏，\n顺利地前进中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c0c892349b4af30929089444fdeda0cef86bf30fd194dc7972c7b4dca0e5fdbb", "ja": "（そして……）", "zh": "（然后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "d6a083cd31657ce84b6b0e6ca6093208c9a99b917ccd1a2ec5ff0abb21b4b23c", "ja": "ケッコー歩いたよね？　真美、もー疲れたよ……。\n兄ちゃん、真美をおんぶしていいよ？", "zh": "已经走很久了吧？真美累了……\n大哥哥，你可以背真美也没关系喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "da32166a8fb671c8dd0dba2c5a70f6ff9062a710bdb1cd31878620b9b7d65d2d", "ja": "ほら、ここならゴリラとかの目しかないし～。\nエンリョはいりませんぜ、ダンナ？", "zh": "你想，这里也只有大猩猩之类的动物会看到嘛～\n不用客气喔，这位客官。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d4894c63366e8be043f3f36a2d549d1ef2f0cb4174631009c375aa8ac1c23ca1", "ja": "別に遠慮はしてないんだが……。", "zh": "我并没有客气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "1d030a2cb41212aeac9e66e76ebb84706859ba30fb92a29242c61abbfb48acf0", "ja": "もうちょっと頑張ろ、まみ！\n……あっ！　向こうに、なにかあるみたいだぞ！", "zh": "再加油一下吧，真美！\n……啊！前面好像有什么东西喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "44f4d137e4f552369b102f1b300121426168306ac826e66c346a495422a1fa74", "ja": "えっ、本当！　お宝かな！？\nたまきち、兄ちゃん！　何してんの、早く行こう！", "zh": "咦，真的耶！是不是宝物！？\n阿环、大哥哥！你们还等什么，快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "2bb4e0b081510f77c4674c875bc6ea2e7eda79b99b5c6b9d880cdb1f838e266c", "ja": "うんっ！　行こ行こ！", "zh": "嗯！走吧走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "64b0731198fcd3b559b111b8a569c907704f52a94160179c156d7e9690a0b57a", "ja": "やれやれ。走って転ばないようにな！", "zh": "真是的，跑步要小心别跌倒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "cb32a45873d9d86e8a880d78c622e5fef9f29cc75e85be40e40904bbbb913479", "ja": "わああ～……！", "zh": "哇啊啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "cb32a45873d9d86e8a880d78c622e5fef9f29cc75e85be40e40904bbbb913479", "ja": "わああ～……！", "zh": "哇啊啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fdac750a19f8409da1af75dabf769bb9fe3d64b349ab674e6d9c09268f893a05", "ja": "これは、遺跡？\nジャングルに、こんなものがあるなんて……。", "zh": "这是遗迹吗？\n没想到丛林里会有这种东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "524ec0178778413725db2a1cc2ddb6a301da4cff0c89552e66e703ec5150a103", "ja": "メッチャ怪しくない！？\nお宝はゼッタイこの中だよ！", "zh": "这里超级可疑的吧！？\n宝物一定就在里面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "a2e6848aead14d3454d2df0f174ed8a7a47c7785a8228f7ac09c5525b2db7cce", "ja": "でも、入り口がしまってて入れないぞ？\nほかに入れそうなとこもないし……。", "zh": "不过入口关着进不去耶。\n好像也没有其他可以进去的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "869ed5b33cb6f3eb5f8c3c6e302c2dc61f10824e659752bede884c3eaaabe4bc", "ja": "うーん、どうにかして、\n中に入る方法があればいいんだが……。", "zh": "嗯──\n要是有办法进去里面就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1015_president", "source_sha256": "bcacdfd949a4c0bf3b3d5a51b2f5b1de2958803327c8cee769e178e550dea200", "ja": "ふっふっふ……。\nまさか君達が、ここまで来るとはね……。", "zh": "呵呵呵……\n没想到你们竟能抵达这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "067539998d57ffbeffc8c3ed27bbf3df3532c80861bb02f2015d46d4dba5b836", "ja": "むむ！\nこの悪役っぽい声は……、社長！", "zh": "唔唔！\n这个听起来像反派的声音是……社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1017_president", "source_sha256": "84e8093b7a0f2ee1f9fc2063c82abc187ff07935ee8eac09618d57237767e99d", "ja": "悪役！？　いやいやいや真美君、\n君は私のことを、そんな風に思ってたのかね！？", "zh": "反派！？不不不，真美，\n原来你一直都是那样看我的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "85e4c0637509327e8c8a7d2f5197b07aedea096c614a7a3ddb7dc0f6e2812209", "ja": "社長だ！　おはよーございまーす！", "zh": "是社长耶！早──安──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1019_president", "source_sha256": "5cdbaa6f00d78877ed2d8d3ae7d842db5de53ff425f4ad0e3148c0bba2f9afab", "ja": "おお、環君、おはよう！　いやあ、君は今日も素直で\n元気で、実にいい子だ！　なのに真美君ときたら……。", "zh": "哦哦，环，早安！哎呀，你今天也这么直率活泼，\n真是个好孩子！反观真美却……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4aeb3e65276279ef3bdc2781d4d39c2a4a583bccc497e076d1c2025d3f885ebb", "ja": "そんなことより！\nどうして社長がここに？", "zh": "先不说这些了！\n社长，为什么你会在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1021_president", "source_sha256": "58d6de1fea64b150ce06903998a9011ae34491ce0e80d832416cea611fc3d0ed", "ja": "君達と同じ理由だよ。\n私にも、叶えたい願いがあってね……。", "zh": "原因跟你们相同。\n我也有想要实现的愿望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1022_president", "source_sha256": "7632deb7e20d22a957a744facec6678eb419629b397921159681e4d8a7f74c64", "ja": "それにしても。君に『ジャングル☆パーティー』を\n渡して、正解だったよ。", "zh": "话说回来，我把『丛林☆派对』交给你，\n是正确的选择呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7310c794b17297deb0ad2133f5b0faba89aa3dc97eb8f87de93b416699e70b9b", "ja": "それは……どういう意味ですか？", "zh": "请问……这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1024_president", "source_sha256": "202316d5612bb12e70be3e3e563e25bea7b6fccfd98557f21634fc0b0024ca96", "ja": "選ばれしアイドルが、『ジャングル☆パーティー』を\n歌うことで、不思議なジャングルへの道は開かれる。", "zh": "只要天选的偶像演唱『丛林☆派对』，\n就会开启前往神秘丛林的道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1025_president", "source_sha256": "9ae396f9bf9f135173c00fbd1bc800fcaff9910c7175f59e534d1a20dcbcbb0d", "ja": "そして、その選ばれしアイドルというのが、\n双海真美君、大神環君。君達のことなのだよ。", "zh": "而所谓天选的偶像，就是指你们两个，\n双海真美、大神环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "30717fce87dbd316df212b71d4b594919a87fbf2fd6426103ac4647fba9663a2", "ja": "うあうあ！　真美たちって、\n選ばれちゃってたの！？", "zh": "呜啊呜啊！\n真美我们是上天选出来的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "a000020a6d6265c7e08ed3cb0ee9a7a55d1a25fe8f833e4380d2dcb099360c9f", "ja": "よくわかんないけど、\nスゴそ～！　やったー♪", "zh": "环听不太懂，不过感觉很厉害～！\n太好了──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ebd3c0388d3345be58eae54b998cee988bcd3d6d476ea437e290d37b0223c1b2", "ja": "ジャングルへの道を開くために、\n社長は俺に『ジャングル☆パーティー』を渡した……。", "zh": "所以社长是为了打开前往丛林的道路，\n才把『丛林☆派对』交给我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1029_president", "source_sha256": "d99fb40561b732b6a2159b1165b8b81b62570a0bcedca2b6c400a5853ef669be", "ja": "そう。私には、かつて、\n叶えられなかった夢があった。", "zh": "没错。\n我有一个过去没能实现的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1030_president", "source_sha256": "a663a5f8668444c81d18cdf077ca8304b6c275ba9ccd10b8bca967ec5a56e51f", "ja": "成功させたものは伝説となる、空前絶後のステージ。\nそんな輝く場所に、彼女を……。", "zh": "办一场空前绝后的表演，成功的人将会成为传说。\n在那种闪耀的地方……我想让她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a7223b0a5391d7049c508050310d2bd64d1fc3437b3c65c622df778c0115c146", "ja": "社長……？", "zh": "社长……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1032_president", "source_sha256": "da23bebf22d076a49192303f8716e8c2cea7a8ded0990b988411544ed52b254a", "ja": "おっと、少ししゃべりすぎたようだ。\n君達には悪いが、願い事は、私が叶えさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "哎呀，看来我有点说太多了。\n抱歉，实现愿望的机会就由我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1033_president", "source_sha256": "c98e4c03b082568e6858f480eab58648fe2e5b771671d8fb65057090db271e7d", "ja": "さあ、蚊に血を吸われる前に、君達は帰りなさい。\n私は全身を蚊に食われて、かゆくてかゆくて……。", "zh": "好了，趁还没被蚊子叮之前，你们先回去吧。\n我全身上下都被叮了，现在痒到不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "20b2eda498e9732b4c18b21b9fa32991402000ceed04b3baeeb1f27d54c4a9fb", "ja": "そういえば……蚊は黒色に集まると、\n聞いたことがありますが……。", "zh": "这么说来……\n我有听说过蚊子会往黑色的地方聚集……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "29d678ec7ebe47fc783eae55b5514e2a293e4641958d5cd6ccfd06d7b230a4e5", "ja": "そんなの、どーでもいいっしょ！？\nそれより真美たち、ゼッタイ帰んないかんね！", "zh": "这些事根本就无所谓吧！？\n还有，真美我们是绝对不会回去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "1557cad64d4109b3f0371df15b4c9b76f59794654e10ff68332056027755d57b", "ja": "そうだぞ！\nたまきも、願いごとかなえたい！", "zh": "对啊！\n环也想实现愿望！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1037_president", "source_sha256": "99830df038e3f092f8b63b789ec3db0c74707bc653707b050f7d3bd982c9a168", "ja": "ふむ。ならば、我が765プロにふさわしい決闘方法で\nどちらの願いを叶えるかを決めようじゃないか！", "zh": "哦，既然如此，就用符合我们765艺能的决斗方式\n来决定要实现谁的愿望吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "36cedd06c486637b968b3e7db5e7494cb4bf674eddc2f3437c6047d5c2b1c5dc", "ja": "765プロにふさわしい決闘……！？\nそれは、一体？", "zh": "符合765艺能的决斗方式……！？\n究竟是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1039_president", "source_sha256": "f37052529970b11f30e30857a5bbcd98d9ef04e55bbd69fe357d7b5b10b570dd", "ja": "うむ。それは……。", "zh": "嗯，那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1040_president", "source_sha256": "fe25f8f9abbb2ee068c067c1d49485ee597c6e0634f72d1b254c3e7c4ce4e032", "ja": "じゃんけんだ！", "zh": "猜拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "fc10529e4cf91d4577a5481f160e85c048f3a9a0e0bf53b7652d3990580ac414", "ja": "はあ。", "zh": "喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1043_president", "source_sha256": "22fff1c3df7c4b3c4e70a2df3b18fcb789104bb0714e2827c3847741242719ea", "ja": "いやあ思い出すよ。昔はよく、アイドルのテンションを\n上げるために、ワザとじゃんけんに負けたものだ。", "zh": "哎呀，真让人怀念。\n我以前很常为了鼓舞偶像，故意输掉猜拳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1044_president", "source_sha256": "b9baf2c94f4c459bf748d5a4f4799047ead02dbedac1f083e37804f4bd61d1e4", "ja": "君も覚えておくといい。\nアイドルのテンション管理は、とても大切なことだよ！", "zh": "你也记在心上比较好。\n管理偶像的情绪可是非常重要的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "83336c543fc2ba9b0297921e1fdbc0bd5e81db7ef6e9e35a4bcfbe04602c8a2f", "ja": "はい、肝に銘じておきます。", "zh": "是，我会铭记在心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "2a0071e35e456b3640023e2c9d49320bf6ed952775e5b71b478b4a429af88a6b", "ja": "んっふっふ～。じゃんけんは真美、自信あるんだ♪\nゼッタイ負けないかんね、社長！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～真美对猜拳很有自信喔♪\n绝对不会输给你的，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1047_040tam", "source_sha256": "bc1a881df6925d9521d3af0e659d3b0a740b28176c3578074154990b61b076b5", "ja": "たまきも、負けないぞ～！", "zh": "环也不会输喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1048_president", "source_sha256": "5c5fe44af6f811a3dc9e85f6c64feb13b71191461e26cf9ec44ab197121b494f", "ja": "うむ。では、始めようか！\n最初はグー！　じゃんけん……！", "zh": "嗯，那么就开始吧！\n剪刀！石头……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1049_012mam", "source_sha256": "e6f4aabf304241c6523c715fc96e635baae596b87ac20d3c587649f1e3a96a1e", "ja": "チョキ！", "zh": "剪刀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1050_040tam", "source_sha256": "e6f4aabf304241c6523c715fc96e635baae596b87ac20d3c587649f1e3a96a1e", "ja": "チョキ！", "zh": "剪刀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1051_president", "source_sha256": "799476784e13ab5645f6e88ef582137dd8e76127ead5c930c8331e1c00f15870", "ja": "グー！", "zh": "石头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1052_040tam", "source_sha256": "2cdc6d273043c4671790194137f3c4ebc9f81f0cb181311191442325e814084a", "ja": "あーっ！？\nたまきもまみも、負けちゃったぞ！？", "zh": "啊──！？\n环跟真美都输掉了喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1053_012mam", "source_sha256": "c786534c176e1ec209244f191b7a90965825fa1fbe72a881c1738ab49c122203", "ja": "うあうあ！　真美たちみたいな子どもを負かすとか、\nイイトシして、はずかしくないの！？", "zh": "呜啊呜啊！你都几岁的人了，\n怎么好意思猜赢真美我们这样的小孩！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1054_president", "source_sha256": "a799eaedac54f4fdf18ab7e6aeb5f2b86403f4c7957b4e24d0d9b87d4feb05b1", "ja": "はずかしくない！　私も長年、社長をしているからね。\nアイドル諸君のじゃんけんのクセはお見通しなのだ！", "zh": "当然好意思！毕竟我当社长也当了很多年，\n早就已经看透诸位偶像在猜拳时的习惯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1055_president", "source_sha256": "0e122bdcae3e9e88963afe6819c9f67445c5b1300739d279e7c40f664b70f374", "ja": "さて。では、私が遺跡の中のお宝を……。", "zh": "好了，那么遗迹里的宝物就由我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1056_p", "source_sha256": "bc4be561b4b80180b577e43270f32b64e91adf8314162900cdee1439f67ca159", "ja": "ちょっと待ってください！\n次は、俺が相手です！", "zh": "请稍等一下！\n社长的下一个对手是我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1057_president", "source_sha256": "108e9bb2f1454242b16cf598f076a222a9ee3a811fc32cffe837e84c7c402602", "ja": "ほう……。かつてないほど、いい目をしているね。\nそれでこそ、765プロのプロデューサーだ！", "zh": "哦……我从没见过你这么炯炯有神的模样呢。\n765艺能的制作人就是要这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1058_p", "source_sha256": "a991668240c814b97ae7f7b81cd7143f2caabb886c66c54541dcf66f1a48b335", "ja": "（勢いで勝負を申し込んでしまったが、普通に\n勝負しても、社長には勝てないかもしれない……）", "zh": "（虽然凭着一股冲劲向社长下战帖，\n但如果照一般的方式比赛，可能赢不了他……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1059_p", "source_sha256": "20ccba5da8fe9b86a196a014b2459492a214c832d4b6111ec4605b972f3153dd", "ja": "（だから、ここは！）", "zh": "（所以现在必须这么做！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1060_p", "source_sha256": "1ea0ebc612de5a56bb86061d2b2c77ffa732f84537134992a99c7c713f4ee5b2", "ja": "俺はパーを出します！", "zh": "我会出布！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1061_040tam", "source_sha256": "d7df15605f9a20e9d89d7a5c9292348344775e0c89358410b077162d74f28621", "ja": "ええっ！　なに出すか教えちゃったら、\n勝てないぞ、おやぶんっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！老大，\n把自己要出的拳告诉别人是赢不了的喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1062_p", "source_sha256": "c2b8a7ea2ed450b67c89f4058422707435707c4d8bece0d3d2700ddf0a4770b9", "ja": "大丈夫だ、環。見てろ！", "zh": "没问题的，环。你看着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1063_president", "source_sha256": "03cf041839f076146714f74a15ced9657a01d4c30058a5ad9c94e3320a5e9497", "ja": "むむむ……。予告通りパーを出す、と見せかけて、\nグーか。はたまた、その裏をついてチョキか……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……他会假装照自己说的出布，最后出石头吗？\n又或是看穿我会这么猜，结果出剪刀呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1064_p", "source_sha256": "25776127e032982e50e553a255e9571ccf941a3ebcc62871247c28c527b89c67", "ja": "行きますよ、社長！\n最初はグー！　じゃーんけーん！", "zh": "要开始啰，社长！\n剪刀！石头──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_1065", "source_sha256": "ae202ea1efce5761a8f1867fab5c99bcea92bd5e37ee4971c1e1609e8113fd30", "ja": "ぽん！", "zh": "布！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2000_012mam", "source_sha256": "dd5d3e8a81960c902a555950c84c64cb630b08b8ddd4acfff0a60f0958d9b51a", "ja": "うあうあ、兄ちゃんホントにパー出してるし！？\n社長は……！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊，大哥哥真的出布了耶！？\n那社长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "5f01a00317bd3547ee39ee65d5c67a7760fc1ddeb7d2eb9903d779d96a82f7ba", "ja": "グー！　おやぶんの勝ちだぞ！", "zh": "石头！是老大赢了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2002_012mam", "source_sha256": "83c3a4dcdd72c8b77b005bc721a610260e447298ee263c417616fd88b4cdc689", "ja": "やったーーー！", "zh": "太好了───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2003_040tam", "source_sha256": "83c3a4dcdd72c8b77b005bc721a610260e447298ee263c417616fd88b4cdc689", "ja": "やったーーー！", "zh": "太好了───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2004_president", "source_sha256": "374e33b9504a684a8d89500187de25226fb0684052a420b4d77d4073e55ccf4f", "ja": "……まさか、宣言通りとはね。完敗だ！\n私の夢は、君に託すとしよう。", "zh": "……没想到你会照预告出拳呢，是我输了！\n我的梦想就托付给你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2005_president", "source_sha256": "0477384b9642fd39afd558a5c0ce195be85ef449f53467780b8fa7f772305ca0", "ja": "いつの日か、765プロのみんなを\nトップアイドルに育ててくれたまえ。頼んだよ、君！", "zh": "总有一天，你要将765艺能的大家\n都培育成顶尖偶像，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2006_p", "source_sha256": "b67e4450bcb23f96896cee27bb1c85166d93e96bb22f0f39eadbaaf14a39c84e", "ja": "はいっ！\n見ていてください、社長……！", "zh": "是！\n请你好好看着吧，社长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0060_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_04_2007_p", "source_sha256": "57593beb8380f0a6af9bd42eb2225cbfce21996d303e3d86cf85556bc3ffefd0", "ja": "それはそうと、この遺跡の扉、\nどうやって開ければいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "话说回来，\n请问这个遗迹的门要怎么开启呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
